docs/v2/B-architecture.md:260:DecisionRecord is a versioned immutable graph of all ten stages, including exact selected/evaluated identity, final validation/payload hash, owned operation, acknowledged/unknown execution and feedback. The SQLite record/artifact store starts in M1; operation/state/claim atomic commits extend it in M5. Generic structured assertions and typed term fields allow later strategy bundles/routers to consume these records without changing evidence, economics or execution. Future behavior models receive read-only historical assessment/feedback views; no learning machinery is part of this delivery.
